<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Futuris to mop up Elders.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Futuris to mop up Elders.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diversified manufacturer Futuris Corp Ltd said on Thursday it would compulsorily acquire the remaining shares in pastoral group Elders Australia Ltd that it does not currently own.</p>
<p>Futuris currently holds 95.32 percent of Elders following its offer of 10 of its shares for every nine Elders shares plus 23 cents per Elders share.</p>
<p>At 3.00 p.m. (0400 GMT), Elders shares were steady at A$2.10 and Futuris shares were four cents up at A$1.81.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
